.TH SOVEREIGN-CLI 1 "May 2026" "v1.0" "Sovereign Mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
sovereign-cli \- Native management interface for the Sovereign Mesh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sovereign-cli
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sovereign-cli
is a native Go-based command-line interface used to interact with the Sovereign Mesh gRPC Control Bus. It provides low-level access to mesh synchronization, neural training orchestration, and citizen registration.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBping\fR
Verify connectivity to the local Mesh Engine. Returns the server status and identity.
.TP
\fBstrike\fR \fIticket_id\fR \fIpayload\fR
Execute a mesh strike mutation. Requires a forensic PQR ticket ID and a logic payload to be reconciled across the mesh.
.TP
\fBtrain\fR \fImodel_name\fR \fIcluster_id\fR
Initiate a neural training session for the specified agent model on a designated node cluster.
.TP
\fBregister\fR \fIusername\fR \fIburn\fR
Register a new citizen in the mesh. Requires a unique username and a CBC burn amount to establish initial TrustScore.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBSNAPSHOT_BUCKET\fR
The Google Cloud Storage bucket used for persisting mesh snapshots.
.TP
\fBRADIUS_SECRET\fR
The secret used for RADIUS-based accounting and authentication audits.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fImudd_session.json\fR
Stores the active MUDD session state and current room position.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B sovereign-cli ping
.PP
.B sovereign-cli strike TICKET-001 "FORCE_HEAL_SEGMENT_38"
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgmudd\fR(1), \fBmesh_control.sh\fR(1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sovereign Mesh Core Developers
